The '''Taurus''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from lava on the [[Crimson Isle]]. 

== Spawning ==
The '''Taurus''' can be fished up from any Lava source on the [[Crimson Isle]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|35}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Taurus''' is {{Green|160}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|3.44%|1|29.05|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
