== Trivia ==
* '''Taurus''' bears some resemblance to the Hog Rider from [[fandom:clashofclans:Hog_Rider|Clash of Clans]] and [[fandom:clashroyale:Hog_Rider|Clash Royale]].
* The word '''Taurus''' means "bull" in Latin and is also one of the twelve Zodiac signs.

